SUMMARY:🚀 [TBD] Falcon 9 · Vast-PAM-1 (Vast ISS Mission 1)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270713
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270714
LOCATION:Space Launch Complex 40\, Cape Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Status: To Be Determined\nTime precision: Day (exact time not y
 et announced)\nOrbit: Low Earth Orbit\nPad: Space Launch Complex 40\, Cape
  Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA\n\nVast’s first private crew rotation to the I
 nternational Space Station aboard a SpaceX Crew Dragon spacecraft\, and NA
 SA's 6th Private Astronaut Mission to the ISS.\n\nThe crew includes ESA/CN
 ES astronaut Thomas Pesquet\, who will serve as Commander for the mission\
 , Czech astronaut Aleš Svoboda\, and Greek astronaut Adrianos Golemis. Th
 e mission will carry 4 astronauts to and from the International Space Stat
 ion for up to 2 weeks.\n\nCountdown & updates: https://benjaminowens612.gi
 thub.io/spacex-launch-alerts/#f3a1a032-5cca-4733-9ca8-04a5a1dba222
